Design influences
-----------------

The architecture of changqing was informed by publicly documented ideas from
other memory systems. No source code from those projects is included here, and
the core package requires no third-party runtime dependency.

    mem0                     https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0
    Zep / Graphiti           https://github.com/getzep/graphiti
    TencentDB-Agent-Memory   https://github.com/Tencent/TencentDB-Agent-Memory
    MemOS                    https://github.com/MemTensor/MemOS

Only mechanisms and concepts were studied; every implementation in this
repository was written independently. See docs/comparison.md for the rationale
and for the boundary we deliberately keep: we borrow mechanisms, we do not take
on a service-oriented dependency.
